senses.gloss:
आ-√ शास् Ā. -शास्ते (aor. 1. pl. आ॑-शिषामहि, RV. viii, 24, 1) to desire, wish, ask, pray for;
to hope, expect, RV.; AV.; TS.; ŚBr.; AitBr.; BhP.; MBh. &c.;
to instruct, order, command, Kathās.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to subdue, RV. ii, 28, 9 [आ॑-शाधि = ‘अनुशिष्टान् कुरु’, Sāy.]

आ-√ सद् P. -सीदति (Ved. also -सदति; Inf. -स॑दम् and -स॑दे, RV.; pf. -ससाद; fut. -सत्स्यति) Ā. (Ved. aor. 1. sg. -सत्सि and 3. sg. -सादि) to sit, sit down, sit near, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.; ŚāṅkhŚr.;
to preside over, RV. viii, 42, 1;
to lie in wait for, RV. x, 85, 32;
to go to, go towards, approach;
to meet with, reach, find;
to encounter, attack;
to commence, undertake, AV.; MBh.; R.; BhP.; Kum.; Ragh. &c.:
Caus. -सादयति, to cause to sit down;
to set down, put down, place, RV.; TS.; ŚBr.; BhP. &c.;
to cause, effect, BhP.;
to approach, meet with, find, reach, obtain, MBh.; R.; Megh.; Kathās.; Pañcat. &c.

आ-√ शंस् P. -शंसति (aor. 1. sg. -शंसिषम्, RV. x, 44, 5) Ā. -शंसते, to hope for, expect;
to wish to attain, desire;
to suspect, fear, RV.; AV.; AitBr.; ĀśvGṛ.; R.; MBh.; Kathās.; Śak.; BhP.; Mn. &c.;
to ask, MBh.; BhP.;
to praise, extol, BhP.;
to tell, speak, recite;
to announce, Śak.; Kum.; BhP.; Daś. :
Caus. (Impv. आ॑-शंसय, RV. i, 29, 1 and [with Wh. and Ro.] AV. xix, 64, 4) to excite, hope for.

आ-√ शक् P. (only RV.; aor. Subj. आ॑-शकत्, viii, 32, 12; pf. 3. pl. आ॑-शेकुस्, x, 88, 17, &c.)
to stimulate;
to bring near, invite;
to aid, help;
to give a share of, let partake:
Desid. Ā. -शिक्षते, to let partake;
to give, bestow, confer, RV. & TBr.

आ-√ शङ्क् Ā. -शङ्कते (seldom P. -सङ्कति) to suspect, fear, doubt, hesitate, MBh.; R.; Kathās.; Hit. &c.;
to expect, suppose, conjecture, think, imagine, Ragh.; Kathās.; Pañcat. &c.;
 (in grammatical and philosophical discussions) to object, state a possible objection ;
to mistrust, Bhaṭṭ.

आ-√ सञ्ज् P. -सजति, to fasten on, attach, fix;
to fasten on one's self, put on (as dress, armour, &c.), RV.; AV.; KātyŚr.; R.; Kum. &c.;
to fix one's self to, adhere to, Kir. xiii, 44;
to take up, MBh. &c.;
to take hold of, cling to, AV.; MBh.; ŚBr.; BhP. &c.:
Caus. -सञ्जयति, to cause to attach or put or fix on ŚāṅkhŚr.; Ragh.;
to employ, MBh. :
Pass. -सज्यते, to adhere, cohere, be attached:
Desid. -सिसङ्क्षति, to wish to attach, ŚBr. i, 6, 1, 12; 15.
